	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Si vales, gaudeo; et ipse valeo, et princeps noster rec<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>te valet.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Eius ad te literas pridie nonarum ianuarii <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>tabellario <placeName ref="l587">Tigurum</placeName> perferendas dedi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">An reddantur recte, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nescio; ego sane vehementer dubito, cum quod per <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>se iam sint hybernae navigationes odiosae, tum quia perva<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>gatum est vitium apud eiusmodi homines, ut vel negligentes <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sint vel omnino infideles; idcirco eas denuo tua causa de<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>scribendas putavi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z9"/>Multa cognosces ex literis, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>quas post <persName ref="p3067">Stumphii</persName> a nobis discessum trinas ad te dedi; <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>gratos tibi optatosque esse, qui de virorum principum <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>benevolentia erga te rumores a me significantur, non dubito, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>mi dulcissime pater, praestaborque et enitar, ut indies magis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>magisque haec inter vos augeatur et conservetur amicitia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Te quidem in dies mehercule habeo chariorem <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>sollicitudinesque meas quotidie magis tua plane summa <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>merita exacuunt, ne quid aut ex amore aut ex iudicio tuo deperdam.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Constans iam aliquot dies <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>per<lb xml:id="p1z20"/>crebuit rumor <persName ref="p591">Iohannem Chekum</persName> auratum militem, regiae <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>maiestatis institutorem, cancellarium <placeName ref="l830">Angliae</placeName> hoc concilio <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>creandum: <placeName ref="l136">Eliensis</placeName> episcopus ad tempus duntaxat <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>isto officio fungitur, donec alius ad illum honorem perpetuus <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>a parliamento decernatur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Tu velim ad illum d<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>iligenter scribas; vir enim tui cum primis est amans ac studiosus, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>praeterea summae existimationis atque dignitatis homo: argumen<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>tum tibi nequaquam deesse poterit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Is unus ac pene <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>solus cum <persName ref="p8107">Treherno</persName> nostrae huius salutis author semper <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>fuit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Deinde <persName ref="p20172">Ulmios</persName> meos, tua commendatione ad <persName ref="p672">Coxum</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>adductus<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>, perquam benigne ac humaniter in aula regis accepit.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z32"/>Postea <persName>Alexandri</persName> studia defendi iuvarique <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>a <placeName ref="l1909">Warwicense</placeName> curaturum se lubenter affirmat<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Titulum <placeName ref="l3029">Warwicensis</placeName> iam plenum ac integrum accepisti; <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>id unum hoc tempore postulat, ut promissa tua exolvas, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>quod ut enitare contendasque, vel potius ut perficias, pos<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>se enim te mihi persuasi, vehementer et etiam atque <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>etiam rogo.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Res maximi est momenti ac ponderis, quod <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>tute ipse pro tua summa prudentia facile cogitabis.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Rectissime feceris (mihi crede) si futuris hisce nundinis <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>literas quam diligentissime ad illum scribas, quibus et <lb xml:id="p2z10"/>studium illi tuum ac operam singulariter deferas, et pro <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>eius celsitudinis erga te benevolentia gratias agas: in <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>his vero omnibus, quae ad tanti principis dignitatem facere <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>videbuntur accurate contexes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Haec hactenus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/><persName ref="p8111">Petrus Martyr</persName> adhuc <placeName ref="l296">Londini</placeName> suas agit partes in <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>constituendis legibus sacris.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Liber eius necdum allatus <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>est: falsissimi sunt <persName ref="p380">Byrkmanni</persName>.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Filia principis <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>convaluit ex magno et periculoso morbo.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Mira nunc <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>parturit, quae in lucem tua cum laude brevi sunt exitura.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z19"/>Inventus est hisce diebus magnus thesaurus optimorum <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>librorum: <persName ref="p18887">Basilius</persName> in Esaiam et Psalmos Graece, et aliquot <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>alia scripta, seu fragmenta potius, eiusdem authoris; <lb xml:id="p2z22"/><persName ref="p4541">Chrysostomus</persName> in evangelia Gręce; integer Proclus; <persName>Por<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>phyrius</persName> et Plotinus Platonici.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Illos libros omnes <lb xml:id="p2z24"/>ipse hoc die vidi.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Reliquum est nunc ut valeas, <lb xml:id="p2z25"/>pater in Christo colendissime, ignoscasque rusticitati <lb xml:id="p2z26"/>mearum literarum; nam et festinans scripsi, et ludis, <lb xml:id="p2z27"/>seriis quidem illis, vehementer impeditus.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l376">Oxonii</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p2z28"/>5 febr. 1552.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z29"/>Tuus discipulus et <lb xml:id="p2z30"/>in Christo filius, <lb xml:id="p2z31"/><persName ref="p20172">Iohannes ab Ulmis</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z32"/>Literas omnes meis includito, praecipue <persName ref="p591">Cheki</persName>: <lb xml:id="p2z33"/>ni effecero ut literas a <placeName ref="l3029">Warwicensi</placeName> accipias, fidem <lb xml:id="p2z34"/>mihi nullam amplius habeto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p3z1"/>Titulus conveniens dignitati <placeName ref="l3029">Warwicensis</placeName>: <lb xml:id="p3z2"/>Illustrissimo principi ac domino, d. <persName ref="p20646">Iohanni Dudlaeo</persName>, <lb xml:id="p3z3"/>potentissimo <placeName ref="l2590">Northumbriae</placeName> vel Northumbrorum<note type="margin">a.R.: ...</note> duci, comiti a <placeName ref="l3029">Warwik</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p3z4"/>domino <persName>Lyslae</persName>, <persName>regnorum Angliae</persName>, <placeName ref="l2665">Hybernię</placeName> et <lb xml:id="p3z5"/><placeName ref="l832">Francię</placeName> regis consiliario summo ac principi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z6"/>Scripsit ad te dux <placeName ref="l1956">Suffolchiae</placeName>, filia eius, <persName ref="p1422">Haddonus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p3z7"/><persName ref="p8151">Elmerus</persName> et <persName ref="p8506">Scinnerus</persName>, quorum literas ad te misi <lb xml:id="p3z8"/>omnes, ut supra ostendi.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p3z9"/><persName ref="p2378">O<lb xml:id="p3z10"/>glethorpus</persName>, doctor et vicecancellarius huius <lb xml:id="p3z11"/>academiae, tuas iam avide expectat literas, itidem <lb xml:id="p3z12"/><persName ref="p1508">Hardingus</persName>, vir absolute doctus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p4z1"/>Ornatissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho <lb xml:id="p4z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> <lb xml:id="p4z3"/>ecclesiae archie<lb xml:id="p4z4"/>piscopo, domino suo <lb xml:id="p4z5"/>longe colendissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p4z7"/>Vom herzogen von <placeName ref="l1956">Suffolk</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
